1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,763
5 things you must do in Turkmenistan.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:08,818
Do try a Turkmen melon in August. There’s
even a national Melon Day.

3
00:00:10,468 --> 00:00:13,268
Do catch Horse Day, on the last Sunday of
April.

4
00:00:14,918 --> 00:00:19,356
Do meet the Akhal-Teke, the golden horse
on the national emblem.

5
00:00:21,006 --> 00:00:23,526
Do declare all your foreign cash when you
land.

6
00:00:25,176 --> 00:00:27,774
Do see a handwoven carpet bigger than a
ten

7
00:00:27,794 --> 00:00:30,472
nis court, at the Carpet Museum in
Ashgabat.
